            "review_title": "Review at Khói Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Thuong Nguyen\n6 contributions\n1\nAn interesting place to explore woodfired fusion food in Hanoi\nFeb 2023\nI have visited here 3 times already and I think this place is worth a review. Other than food, I was impressed by how well the staff was trained. The service was super good and it is one of the top reasons for why I will come back here in the future. \n\nI enjoyed the food at Khoi, especially the dry aged pork chop, the beef rib and all the desserts in the menu. However, I think there are still rooms for improvements. The food is a little bit salty. And personally, I expected to have more carb dishes in the menu, such as I pastas, etc. I think it would be a perfect choice for foreigners to try out fusion cuisine (I heard that the Chef has experiences working in Japan for a long time). \n\nOne more thing I like about this restaurant is a wide variety of wine choices and cocktails freshly made in front of you in the bar. Overall, I would def come back with my friends to try out some of the food in the menu. But I hope to see more food when I have the opportunity.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 21, 2023",
